{"id":"wx2652888453","title":"华南农业大学召开树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育推进会","published_at":"2026-06-09T10:40:33+08:00","published_label":"2026-06-09","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBvP8icCvdyAJQYceNJALvB89q2FY08OmgANYSVQu3DME948TyLYnlE4Lfl3bTXWqicfkCEEKBpjwGPsZ7hgiafJygCzvFyXrR6DE/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"6月8日 华南农业大学召开 树立和践行正确政绩观 学习教育推进会 总结学习教育开展以来的阶段性成效 对下一阶段深化学习教育 推动学校高质量发展 进行重点部署 校党委书记李凤亮作专题讲话 校党委副书记、 校长薛红卫主持会议 推进会现场 李凤亮…","tags":["科研","人物"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652888453&idx=1&sn=3a67c7fea96ac6bcccbd94a76c270d47","paper_url":null,"word_count":2141,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:34:32+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcib9OUORJLexR67iaNiaHMVsUPnrMCxOs4d75byZVqb9icp60drwxLtIDbs1v6NLBtGH2FfIrVwwNyQmw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>6月8日</span></span></p><p><span><span>华南农业大学召开</span></span></p><p><span><span>树立和践行正确政绩观</span></span></p><p><span><span>学习教育推进会</span></span></p><p><span><span>总结学习教育开展以来的阶段性成效</span></span></p><p><span><span>对下一阶段深化学习教育</span></span></p><p><span><span>推动学校高质量发展</span></span></p><p><span><span>进行重点部署</span></span></p><p><span><span>校党委书记李凤亮作专题讲话</span></span></p><p><span><span>校党委副书记、</span></span><span><span>校长薛红卫主持会议</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDYQQCHTI1jD1AsH3CQQchpOkFiaxREibck9XjuGtYwjPo0GrFTlfGZkGqG8WeV0H9Za7AvuPa7WbF8HunqmNeuK1fNbrCuDYaxo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>推进会现场</span></span></section><p><span><span>李凤亮指出，召开学校树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育推进会，既是对党中央决策部署和省委工作要求的贯彻落实，也是以正确政绩观校准航向、保障“双一流”建设行稳致远的工作需要。他强调，全校上下要以此次学习教育为契机，摒弃“虚浮气”，练就“实干功”，重点做好三个方面工作。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>一要端正出发点，既要解近忧还要谋远虑。</span><span>要在深学上下实功，原原本本学、对照典型学、知行合一学，破除“学做两张皮”；在导向上明规矩，守牢意识形态阵地，明晰学科调整方向，确保学校党委决策部署不折不扣落地见效；在查摆上动真格，学校学习教育工作专班要做好学习教育统筹督导，强化分析研判，压实整改责任。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>二要找准发力点，既要靠实干还要会巧干。</span><span>实干的本质，就是做难而正确的事。全校各单位既要发扬“钉钉子”精神，深入抓、抓深入，一步一个脚印地把蓝图变为现实；更要学会“弹钢琴”，在具体抓、抓具体的同时，讲究章法与策略，通过转作风、树新风，让学校管理既有制度的硬度，更要有服务的温度。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>三要锚定攻坚点，既要啃硬骨还要理旧账。</span><span>要以攻坚精神做好“难事”，把抓实基层党建作为打基础、添动能、利长远的战略工程；以担当意识做好“旧事”，拿出切实可行的解决方案，有效解决历史遗留问题；以奋进姿态做好“要事”，立足“攻坚跨越”年度主题，加快推进“十五五”规划编制工作，有力有效推动年度重点工作落地落实。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>李凤亮还就落实纪律教育学习月活动、深化教育领域突出问题整治、做好以案促改促治工作、推动行权数字化与监督数字化以及深化拓展整治形式主义等五个方面的工作提出了明确要求。</span></span></p><p><span><span>薛红卫指出，要贯彻落实好本次推进会会议精神，进一步抓好下一阶段工作。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>一要在深化认识、提高站位上持续发力。<span>要把学习贯彻习近平总书记关于树立和践行正确政绩观的重要论述作为首要政治任务，坚决克服“过关”心态和“松劲”情绪，将正确政绩观贯穿办学治校全过程。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>二要在深学细查、动真碰硬上持续发力。<span>要坚持把学习成果转化为工作成效，聚焦人才培养、学科建设、师资队伍、民生保障等关键领域，深入剖析短板弱项，坚决防止学习教育流于形式。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>三要在真抓实干、推动发展上持续发力。<span>要牢固树立“以师生为中心”的发展思想，把树立和践行正确政绩观同编制“十五五”规划、推进“双一流”建设、落实学校年度重点任务等中心工作紧密结合起来，将学习成果转化为高质量发展实绩。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>四要在建章立制、压实责任上持续发力。<span>要及时总结学习教育中行之有效的经验做法，各级党组织要层层压实责任链条，确保学习教育善始善终、善作善成。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>会议强调，全校各级党组织和广大党员干部要以此次推进会为新起点，以更加务实的作风创造经得起实践、师生和历史检验的实绩，为加快建设农业特色世界一流大学作出新的更大贡献。</span></span></p><p><span><span>资产与实验室管理处、公共管理学院、园艺学院、测试中心（实验动物中心）就学习教育开展情况作交流分享。</span></span></p><p><span><span>校党政领导，校党委委员、纪委委员，全校副处级以上干部，学校学习教育工作专班全体成员参加会议。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckA9OZugvK4GoV6nywOPicWI6TIGZAcD0FFsrpWCga39sNg8OcQPtfMicSteG0yWlia4OqU6hpjO7sXpzocwwqgeLU87SInhRrJs4Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>     一体推进学查改见行见效       </span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDiaTlWVSB7dAcCPzJicNqQDCEptFD7iaY6icNhKzS93PPUHYH8w1O0DbXgD7MAcwLDM5WibzBgEl3dYtbe9NqP7OpHplnkzINWdIQU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>学习教育开展以来，学校党委认真谋划、精心组织，坚持学查改一体推进，将学习教育同事业发展有机融合。全校各级党组织扎实开展专题读书班、中心组学习、支部活动、专题党课等活动，校领导班子和各个二级单位紧密结合工作实际，深入查摆整改问题。学校在省委教育工委学习教育视频调度会议上作经验介绍。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAWtUKkv26H6kK5ExiciaTSPBib6PekDMDGvasicC5CUEgEoiamJwic2iaFWV0X5MeR4yMzWtAJBaUu7RqNjDqG6ROnicF0GaRK1T5kzbI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>■ </span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span>日至</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日，学校举行学习教育读书班暨党委理论学习中心组（扩大）学习会。</span><span>全国人大代表、学校动物科学学院院长谢青梅教授，广东省委党校（广东行政学院）法学教研部副主任马俊军教授，中国新闻文化促进会会长、《人民日报》社原副总编辑张首映作专题报告。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCS1icyAa3WR66k6CN1eGOdsBiaCibNBo98XRVz74Ptxdb6qibWcE6G4icaYAEf9ETxP5sKY6AL5PCibmzW2MwCuvjuEbNyXZbM2hVho/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>■ </span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>28</span></span><span><span>日，</span></span><span><span>学校举行学习教育第二期读书班暨党委理论学习中心组（扩大）学习会。</span><span>聚焦加快推进学科交叉融合主题进行深入学习研讨。特邀中国农业大学讲席教授、全球食物经济与政策研究院院长樊胜根作专题报告。集体学习研讨阶段，与会校领导结合分管工作作重点发言，领学</span></span><span><span>《习近平关于树立和践行正确政绩观论述摘编》</span></span><span><span>相关章节。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCoVRGIEnBqLXJicMeLhv9muevX9hpfA00icGQUiaicKPZgbCjh6nQK0RkVjrSNgqD93Zbl3o2dcvvvaBJ8f0BswgGdwDAxcUVN52w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>■ </span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>日，学校党委理论学习中心组赴广东海大集团股份有限公司开展专题调研暨学习教育第三期读书班</span><span>，实地了解企业科技创新与成果转化情况，围绕产教融合、服务“百千万工程”等深入座谈交流。与会校领导分别领学《习近平关于树立和践行正确政绩观论述摘编》相关章节，并作重点发言。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学校党委将</span></span><span><span>扎实推进</span></span></p><p><span><span>学习教育走深走实</span></span></p><p><span><span>以更高标准、更严要求、更实作风</span></span></p><p><span><span>推动学校事业高质量发展</span></span></p><p><span><span>为加快建设农业特色世界一流大学</span></span></p><p><span><span>作出新的更大贡献</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBOic9xRD6h6Bm8H7ESYhRHA8FgoSxBic6eJGYFwvyBRUrtdFJiaBicUZ7s6u0rbbuIyUGsaxD8dhODLvE4pEysJmnCNxkGoiazwl5E/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652876309&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0274d3aa6ee0417c7c82c513a6544f79&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCGFhVwPqicpTKaQZ0LcWIBdafcpcrEgpEyodz1o8hvicoBW2wEAMZC91icN4p1UIpj6YPVmFcL9wXqwEHALjKl4LZLbaZA3j9M1w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span>华南农业大学党委部署开展树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育</span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652888393&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e2d1480f9ae25b76d8e23e44d0464378&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDm6d2hwGQ2jeEwjcmGCllQ2E1Q5xzbTxcoddc0vRyUpzy9qQAX33mzZQ7q6TZOO0szjCmBr8Lk90YuJAyDpVeQjicW0P8iaNCZY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span><span>9校联动，守护蔚蓝！</span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652887292&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=64dd10debec139f4b9e5d5243c8c274f&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCJcg8DgjkNPH6KBk4efAamqScKkuwKd4WV9DJ8pujdUibnZnlWBLly0z5SV8iam0tVBVtEjLiaBiaO1ZicucK7dpfsxqR9lBptA6Zc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span><span>水稻绕月飞行后会怎样？｜华农科研进展</span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBgicdDnWfnlLk5Gef14Xiax2NyMic34V60iaaWHbkuibQbVCW29GhfXKosXU0wFL6gHGASVlE45j5Eicj68gOQa9N82liaXtpXWibvmuY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>-SCAU-</span></p><p><span>文图丨学习教育工作专班</span></p><p><span>初审丨曾子焉</span></p><p><span>复审丨陈芃辰</span></p><p><span>终审丨钟耿涛</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>“</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAQhuicgs6NlCxiad1tO6duibQIMdshTqcpJwBwtRIex9v9icUF3rsYh8F8ZDLK65EicOsM6HKGP5T5KxNmk8ic8XsNNwn7GMEdhcQF4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>”</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>扫码关注华农官微，获取最新资讯</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAyk4iaibrqGwVHYeQ9qoTnDLxGY4uiaibyfg1xJRiaKekfNYxHFnDibg2r4KpxA1ywMArgoPEAHb5EbeaTocSGfXoDQjKXDxUZvsPtU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>点赞</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckCunthXiaibHygdWKoxNZI4yxMh1nv5SFapZFAKRQguUYRB4V8Nlc7peibuzWO4GD1MZicf6bs8sx9mzkPngytAYeHUOAbgxVicpmAE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>分享</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckDibK9bMAT9BQSicJ2b3SxpG6npavxtsUzf7Ck5VQNic0OfHVUiaryHGBaibrZQdtpeEjoIIFbbKlE62TdSW3BTjEk53T0DjQU5iaib6w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>推荐</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckB8ppOHyfEaGliaQt4qiaiavLlMSsJaTJ2DWoFgmj8frxdtvdVNtZEicz9JyTyRYhKgYr9OJeSoI1r8ElDlEMdiaOPJibSQv4vHDsuuI/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></div>"}
